+---
+title: Derive the deleted line item index from the order line items
+issue: NEXT-00000
+---
+# Administration
+* Announced the removal of parameter `itemIndex` from method `onDeleteItem` in component `sw-order-line-items-grid`. With feature flag `v6.8.0.0` the deleted index is derived from the order line items.
